WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:15.370
X ten is the Spieker Center of triangle A B C: the incenter of the medial triangle M sub a, M sub b, M sub c, the center of the inscribed Spieker circle, and the physical center of mass of the triangle's uniform wire perimeter.

2
00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:27.496
Its barycentric coordinates are simply b plus c, to c plus a, to a plus b, and its trilinear coordinates are b c times b plus c, to c a times c plus a, to a b times a plus b.

3
00:00:27.496 --> 00:00:40.480
On the central lines layer, X ten lies on the Nagel line as the exact midpoint between Incenter X one and Nagel point X eight, and on the Orthocenter–Mittenpunkt line through X four and X nine.

4
00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:50.340
X ten is the complement of the Incenter X one, the radical center of the three excircles, the isogonal conjugate of X fifty-eight, and the isotomic conjugate of X eighty-six.
